, or managed hosting, we recommend using ",[207,208,210],"a",{"href":209},"cloud","FiveNet Cloud",".",[213,214],"br",{},"\nPlease ensure you have sufficient experience with these technologies before attempting installation. Community-based support is available for installation and configuration.",[217,218,220],"h2",{"id":219},"self-hosted","Self-hosted",[222,223,224,233],"card-group",{},[225,226,230],"card",{"icon":227,"title":228,"to":229},"i-mdi-docker","Docker","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fcontainer-docker",[191,231,232],{},"Learn how to set up FiveNet using Docker and the Docker Compose plugin.",[225,234,238],{"icon":235,"title":236,"to":237},"i-mdi-kubernetes","Kubernetes","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fkubernetes-helm",[191,239,240],{},"Deploy FiveNet on Kubernetes using our Helm Chart.",[217,242,244],{"id":243},"cloud-hosted","Cloud-hosted",[191,246,247,248,211],{},"For those who prefer a hassle-free experience, FiveNet Cloud offers a streamlined way to run FiveNet for your roleplay server. Learn more on the ",[207,249,250],{"href":209},"Cloud info page",[225,252,255],{"icon":253,"title":210,"to":254},"i-mdi-cloud","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fcloud",[191,256,257],{},"Get started with FiveNet Cloud for a fully managed solution, eliminating the need for manual setup and maintenance. Perfect for those who want to focus on their roleplay server without worrying about infrastructure.",{"title":259,"searchDepth":260,"depth":260,"links":261},"",2,[262,263],{"id":219,"depth":260,"text":220},{"id":243,"depth":260,"text":244},"md",null,{},true,"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fmethods",{"title":186,"description":193},"1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F1.methods","GTx_J8DS6z83h5Ab-A0j3tlRPq5-OLcdUU_rgT_TBzo",[273,278],{"title":274,"path":275,"stem":276,"description":277,"children":-1},"Versioning","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fversioning","1.getting-started\u002F3.versioning","Learn how FiveNet version numbers are structured and what release and development builds mean.",{"title":40,"path":254,"stem":279,"description":280,"children":-1},"1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F2.cloud","FiveNet Cloud is available today as a managed hosting option for communities that want us to run and maintain FiveNet for them.",1788932302771]